      "portrait": "gothic copperplate etching illustration, half-length portrait of a 24-year-old Hanseatic Northern European young woman, late-medieval northern fantasy, Hanseatic port era, an arbiter's scribe and clerk, small build, youthful round cheeks, pale blonde hair in two braids pinned up, round wire spectacles, ink stains on her fingers and cuffs, plain grey wool dress with a white linen collar, a quill tucked behind her ear, earnest thoughtful expression, fine black cross-hatched ink lines on aged parchment with blood-red accents, gothic copperplate etching illustration",
